As gargoyles are weak to crush, many players bring a crush-focused weapon such as the [[Sarachnis cudgel]] for this task.

Praying [[Protect from Melee]] will negate all damage from regular gargoyles. If players have the [[Bigger and Badder]] slayer perk unlocked, there is a chance for [[marble gargoyle]]s to spawn. These superior variants use both melee and ranged attack styles. Be careful, as getting hit by the special attack can be dangerous.
