*A [[slayer ring]] to teleport to the slayer tower
*A [[rock hammer]] to kill the [[gargoyles]] (if not using a granite hammer as a main weapon)
*[[Divine rune pouch]] / [[Rune pouch]] with fire, nature, law, and dust runes to cast High Alchemy and Teleport to House (set warning value to 50,000)

